<title>JAPAN: Japan May palladium imports down 38.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan May palladium imports down 38.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's palladium imports in May fell by 38.4 percent from a year earlier to 5.016 tonnes, Finance Ministry data released on Friday showed.  </p>
<p>	     The figures were as follows (in kg):</p>
<p>		    May 97     Apr 97	  May 96</p>
<p> Total	    5,016	 6,078	   8,138</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Russia	   1,514	 2,834	   5,512</p>
<p> South Africa   1,095	   954	   1,387</p>
<p>Cumulative imports in the first five months of 1997 amounted to 37.91 tonnes, up from 33.97 tonnes in the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-7431</p>
</text>
